Subject: coerce/trails/rest: shared groundwork for the coverage overhaul

- coerce: groomed -> open, race -> closed (trail vocab seen across many
  report pages)
- trails levels: expertonly, terrainparks, terrain, medium, hard aliases
- fixJson flag on api/trails urls: tolerant JSON parse for feeds with
